
Date-n-Time (ver 2.03.02)
FAR 1.60+ plugin to use Date and Time in editor, command line and clipboard.

- Date indicator (a'la DN).
- Flexible color, position, format for date indicator.
- Flexible date indicator behavior.
- Insert Date and/or Time to editor, command line, clipboard.
- !New! Flexible Dialogs technology.
- SmartPad (a'la DN).
- Dialog Generator API description and header-file.
- Text parsing functions within Dialog Generator API (a'la regexp).
- !NEW! Calendar.
- !NEW! 4 calendar design.